(Q: Beyond the battery itself, what key components and functionalities constitute the) Tj
T* ('system approach' for implementing advanced lead-acid battery energy storage for grid) Tj
T* (applications, and what are their primary benefits?) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 12 Tf
13.7999999999999989 TL
0. 0.392 0. rg
56.6929133858267775 547.086850393700729 Td
(A: The 'system approach' for advanced lead-acid battery energy storage includes thermal) Tj
T* (management of the UltraBattery bank, an inverter/charger, and smart grid management.) Tj
T* (Smart grid management monitors the State of Charge \(SoC\) and State of Health \(SoH\) to) Tj
T* (ensure operation within an optimum SoC window, maximizing UltraBattery longevity. It also) Tj
T* (trends SoH to allow cell replacement at a convenient time without affecting system) Tj
T* (operation. Furthermore, remote monitoring and control capabilities reduce the running cost) Tj
T* (of the system. These components collectively enhance reliability, extend battery life, and) Tj
T* (optimize performance for renewable energy and grid applications.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 14 Tf
16.0999999999999979 TL
0. g
56.6929133858267775 308.9766141732283131 Td
(Card 2/10) Tj
